MF=32                                                             1125 1451  134
   Uncertainty files for the resonance parameters below 32 keV    1125 1451  135
 are estimated from the literature for the 2.81 keV resonance,    1125 1451  136
 and an area analysis for the 7.6 keV resonance.  Results from    1125 1451  137
 the multilevel analysis, capture areas, and area analysis form   1125 1451  138
 the basis for the remainder of the resonance parameter errors.   1125 1451  139
 The uncertainties in the resonance parameters are most useful    1125 1451  140
 in self-shielding work.                                          1125 1451  141
